      "quoteId": "2026-08-26: 'On August 26, 2026, we notified developers using whisper-1, gpt-4o-transcribe, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe, and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize of their deprecation and removal from the API on February 26, 2027.' (recommended replacement gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe) (verified 2026-10-06)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": {
    "migration": "OpenAI shuts down whisper-1, gpt-4o-transcribe, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize on 2027-02-26. After that date these calls fail. OpenAI recommends gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe. Check that the output format your code reads is still supported before switching.",
    "edgeCases": [
      "A model name read from an environment variable, a config file or a variable set elsewhere is not found.",
      "Dated gpt-4o-mini-transcribe snapshots are a separate notice with an earlier date and are not matched here."
    ]
  },
